# Canonical text form is LF, enforced at checkout too (mirrors the parent
# DeepSeek Harness repo). Shell scripts in particular break on CRLF; without
# this, a global `core.autocrlf=true` re-checks them out as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets Git must never line-ending-convert.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.tgz binary
